{
  "slug": "seo-content-pipeline",
  "name": "Seo Content Pipeline",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "End-to-end SEO content pipeline connecting keyword research through to rank tracking. Validate and score keyword opportunities with DataForSEO, generate SERP-feature-targeted briefs, write GEO-optimised drafts, audit existing content for decay and cannibalization, and track ranking changes over time. Includes 5 skills: keyword-research, serp-brief, content-draft, content-audit, and rank-tracker.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **1 agent**, **5 commands** and **6 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `content-audit` (Audit existing published content for SEO decay, thin content, cannibalization, and GEO gaps), `content-draft` (Generate a GEO-optimised content draft from a brief), `keyword-research` (Validate and score keyword opportunities using DataForSEO data), `rank-tracker` (Track keyword rankings over time, detect title rewrites by Google, flag position changes, and surface internal linking opportunities…), `serp-brief` (Generate a SERP-feature-targeted content brief)\n- **Agents** (1): `content-pipeline-run` (Autonomous Sunday content pipeline)\n- **Commands** (5): `audit` (Audit all published content for SEO decay, thin pages, and cannibalization), `brief` (Generate a SERP-feature-targeted content brief), `draft` (Write a full GEO-optimised content draft from a brief), `ranks` (Weekly rank tracking report), `research` (Research keyword opportunities)\n- **MCP servers** (6): `~~serp_data`, `~~search_console`, `~~analytics`, `~~crawler`, `~~knowledge_base`, `~~documents`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install seo-content-pipeline@claude-community` from `arturseo-geo/cowork-seo-content-pipeline`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
